---
import ClubLayout from '../../../layouts/ClubLayout.astro';
---

<ClubLayout
  name="Cardiff University Jiu Jitsu Club"
  description="Japanese Jiu Jitsu training at Cardiff University’s Talybont Sports Centre, with sessions on Monday, Wednesday and Thursday evenings."
  heroImage="/clubs/cardiff-university.webp"
  heroImageMobile="/clubs/cardiff-university-mobile.webp"
  when={['Mondays 5.30-7.30pm', 'Wednesdays 7.30-9.30pm', 'Thursdays 7.30-9.30pm']}
  where="South Hall, Cardiff University, Talybont Sports Centre, 12 Bevan Place, Cardiff, CF14 3UX"
  contacts={[
    { label: 'Instagram: jitsu.cardiffuni', href: 'https://www.instagram.com/jitsu.cardiffuni/', newTab: true },
    { label: 'Email', href: 'mailto:jiujitsu@cardiff.ac.uk' },
  ]}
>
  <div slot="before-contact" class="section grid">
    <section class="card">
      <h2>Your first session</h2>
      <p>
        If you are interested in trying out, we recommend arriving 10–15
        minutes early.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or want to see what we do, have a look at
        our <a href="https://www.instagram.com/jitsu.cardiffuni/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Arriving at the dojo</h2>
      <p>
        To access the changing rooms, go up the stairs in front of reception.
      </p>
      <p>
        To find us, turn left from reception and follow the corridor to South
        Hall. We usually train on court 4 or 5; the court numbers are on the
        wall.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Costs and trial sessions</h2>
      <p>Your first three sessions with us are free. After that, mat-fee plans are:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>£60 — full year</li>
        <li>£45 — academic year</li>
        <li>£25 — half year</li>
        <li>£12.50 — quarter year</li>
        <li>£2 — individual session</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You will also need a licence from our Association, The Jiu Jitsu
        Foundation, which costs £38/year. There is no upfront payment during
        the first two weeks.
      </p>
      <p>
        As we are a University Society, Cardiff University students who wish
        to make us their home club need an AU membership, which costs
        £32.50/year. To purchase an Associate Membership, contact us through
        Instagram or email.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>What should I wear?</h2>
      <p>
        For your first few sessions, wear comfortable clothing such as joggers
        and a T-shirt. We train barefoot, although you may wear socks if you
        prefer. Afterwards, you can purchase a gi, our training suit.
      </p>
      <p>
        Remove or cover all jewellery, tie up long hair and bring a water
        bottle. Free refill stations are available.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Who can attend?</h2>
      <p>
        Most of our members are students, but you do not have to be. We also
        welcome students from other universities.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you are under 18 and would like to attend, please contact us before
        coming along.
      </p>
      <p>
        TJJF members who already have a home club may attend our sessions as
        long as they pay mat fees. No membership with us is needed.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</ClubLayout>
